#{[17592186573311 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573190 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573311 #edb/ref 1069 "q-1330" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573311 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573311 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $\\overset{\\to }{U}=⟨7,-1⟩.$ Find $|\\,\\overset{\\to }{U}|.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573311 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "de84f93a-9a95-5709-8b3a-1c7aaa638199" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573311 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,\\overset{\\to }{U}| & =\\sqrt{{u}_{x}^{2}+{u}_{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(7)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{49+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{50} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25\\cdot 2} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186573211 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1069 "q-125137" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $r=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find a unit vector that is parallel to $r$ and points the same direction." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "efcda90e-97e9-5de4-ab6e-f342fb013418" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186573320 #edb/ref 1074 "Remember that to find a unit vector that is parallel to a given vector and points the same direction, we need to divide the given vector by its length:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =\\frac{r}{|\\,r\\,|}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,r\\,| & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(-6)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+36} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{45} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide $r$ by its length and get the following unit vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =\\frac{r}{|r|} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{5}}\\cdot r \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{5}}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
